  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.0 – IMPORTANT NOTICE\n    This version introduces significant breaking changes that may require updates to your existing code.\n\n    - Migrated from .NET Standard 2.0 to .NET 10.0\n    - Added convenience methods for working with paths and path steps\n    - Added cooperative cancellation support\n    - Improved path and connection data structures for clarity and robustness\n    - Improved the handling of start and destination nodes, decoupling their selection from the node map structure\n    - Replaced generic node identifiers with integer identifiers\n    - Removed node wrappers and standardized the public API on integer node identifiers\n    - Moved traversal costs from nodes to directed path connections\n    - Path step collections are now immutable\n    - Removed multi-path search to focus the API on the least-cost path produced by A*\n    - Left application content under the ownership of node-map providers\n    - Added Dijkstra behavior when no heuristic provider is supplied\n    - Added optional tie-breaker providers for equal-score candidates and equal-cost parent alternatives\n    - Added built-in 2D and 3D heuristic and line-deviation calculations\n    - Removed obsolete types and members\n    - Performance optimizations",
